Bharathi morning-la phone unlock panna Outlook down, Teams down, bank payment pending, flight status delayed!

Internet ku fever vandhuruchunu ela nenaikaranga.

November twelfth, Microsoft-oda Outlook, Teams, Copilot global-ah down aachu. Software fix-la irundha networking bug, heavy traffic vandhappo gateway servers-ah freeze panniduchu. More than eighty percent gateway servers unresponsive!

Adutha naal, FAA network problem nala America-la nationwide flight ground stop. Thousands of flights affected!

November sixteenth, Chase Bank-la transaction delays. Cyberattack illa, hardware system-la software bug!

November seventeenth, CISA Java4Shell vulnerability-ku urgent warning issue pannuchu. Affected systems-ku immediate patch apply panna sollirukkaanga!

Indha incidents connected-nu evidence illa. Aana oru chinna bug, banking-la irundhu aviation varaikkum impact create pannalaam!

Backup system-um fail aana enna aagum?

Indha week-la ungalukku most shocking incident edhu? Comment pannunga!





